          "code": "import numpy as np\n\n# Audit Produksi 1: Kegagalan Ranking Cold-Start pada Distribusi Impresi Power-Law\nrng = np.random.default_rng(42)\nn_items = 600\ntrue_ctr = rng.beta(3.0, 97.0, size=n_items)  # Mean CTR sejati = 3.0%\n# Impresi heavy-tail: mayoritas item baru hanya punya 1-20 impresi\nimpr = np.maximum(1, rng.pareto(1.4, size=n_items).astype(int) * 4)\nclicks = rng.binomial(impr, true_ctr)\n\nmle_est = clicks / impr\nlaplace_naive = (clicks + 1.0) / (impr + 2.0)  # BUG: Beta(1,1) mean=50%!\neb_est = (clicks + 3.0) / (impr + 100.0)       # Empirical Bayes Beta(3,97)\n\ndef eval_top_k(est, truth, k=20):\n    top_idx = np.argsort(-est)[:k]\n    rmse = np.sqrt(np.mean((est - truth) ** 2))\n    return rmse, truth[top_idx].mean()\n\nprint(\"Audit Ranking Top-20 Iklan pada 600 Produk (Distribusi Impresi Power-Law):\")\noracle_top20 = np.sort(true_ctr)[-20:].mean()\nprint(f\"  Oracle Top-20 True CTR            : {oracle_top20:.4f}\")\nfor label, pred in [(\"MLE Mentah (k/n)\", mle_est), (\"Laplace Naif Beta(1,1)\", laplace_naive), (\"Empirical Bayes Beta(3,97)\", eb_est)]:\n    rmse, top20_true = eval_top_k(pred, true_ctr, k=20)\n    print(f\"  {label:28s} | RMSE={rmse:.4f} | True CTR Top-20={top20_true:.4f}\")\n\n# Audit Produksi 2: Non-Invariansi MAP terhadap Reparameterisasi (theta vs logit phi)\n# Posterior Beta(alpha=3, beta=9) -> mode di ruang theta = (a-1)/(a+b-2) = 2/10 = 0.20\na, b = 3.0, 9.0\ntheta_map = (a - 1.0) / (a + b - 2.0)\n# Transformasi phi = log(theta/(1-theta)) => p_phi(phi) = p_theta(sig(phi)) * |dtheta/dphi|\n# Karena |dtheta/dphi| = theta*(1-theta), eksponen naik +1 => mode di phi ada di a/(a+b) = 3/12 = 0.25!\nphi_grid = np.linspace(-5.0, 5.0, 20001)\nsig = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-phi_grid))\nlog_post_phi = a * np.log(sig) + b * np.log(1.0 - sig)\nphi_map = phi_grid[np.argmax(log_post_phi)]\ntheta_from_phi_map = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(-phi_map))\n\nprint(\"--- Bukti Non-Invariansi MAP di Bawah Transformasi Logit (Beta(3, 9)) ---\")\nprint(f\"  MAP langsung di ruang probabilitas theta : {theta_map:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"  sigmoid(MAP di ruang logit phi)          : {theta_from_phi_map:.4f} (bergeser akibat Jacobian!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Audit Ranking Top-20 Iklan pada 600 Produk (Distribusi Impresi Power-Law):\n  Oracle Top-20 True CTR            : 0.0834\n  MLE Mentah (k/n)             | RMSE=0.1587 | True CTR Top-20=0.0371\n  Laplace Naif Beta(1,1)       | RMSE=0.2646 | True CTR Top-20=0.0345\n  Empirical Bayes Beta(3,97)   | RMSE=0.0171 | True CTR Top-20=0.0485\n--- Bukti Non-Invariansi MAP di Bawah Transformasi Logit (Beta(3, 9)) ---\n  MAP langsung di ruang probabilitas theta : 0.2000\n  sigmoid(MAP di ruang logit phi)          : 0.2500 (bergeser akibat Jacobian!)",
