          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.optimize import minimize\n\n# Eksperimen Fundamental: Forward KL (Mode-Covering) vs Reverse KL (Mode-Seeking)\n# Target bimodal P(x) = 0.5*N(-3, 0.7^2) + 0.5*N(+3, 0.7^2)\nx = np.linspace(-8.0, 8.0, 1601)\ndx = x[1] - x[0]\n\ndef norm_pdf(grid, mu, sigma):\n    return np.exp(-0.5 * ((grid - mu) / sigma) ** 2) / (sigma * np.sqrt(2.0 * np.pi))\n\np = 0.5 * norm_pdf(x, -3.0, 0.7) + 0.5 * norm_pdf(x, 3.0, 0.7)\np = p / (np.sum(p) * dx)\n\ndef forward_kl(params):\n    mu, log_sig = params\n    sig = np.exp(log_sig)\n    q = np.clip(norm_pdf(x, mu, sig), 1e-300, None)\n    return float(np.sum(p * np.log(np.clip(p, 1e-300, None) / q)) * dx)\n\ndef reverse_kl(params):\n    mu, log_sig = params\n    sig = np.exp(log_sig)\n    q = np.clip(norm_pdf(x, mu, sig), 1e-300, None)\n    return float(np.sum(q * np.log(q / np.clip(p, 1e-300, None))) * dx)\n\nres_fwd = minimize(forward_kl, x0=[0.5, np.log(2.0)], method=\"BFGS\")\nres_rev = minimize(reverse_kl, x0=[2.0, np.log(1.0)], method=\"BFGS\")\n\nmu_f, sig_f = res_fwd.x[0], np.exp(res_fwd.x[1])\nmu_r, sig_r = res_rev.x[0], np.exp(res_rev.x[1])\n\n# Hitung densitas yang ditaruh Q di titik lembah x = 0.0 (padahal P(0) ~ 0)\np_zero = norm_pdf(0.0, -3.0, 0.7)\nq_fwd_zero = norm_pdf(0.0, mu_f, sig_f)\nq_rev_zero = norm_pdf(0.0, mu_r, sig_r)\n\nprint(\"Aproksimasi Distribusi Bimodal P = 0.5*N(-3,0.7^2) + 0.5*N(+3,0.7^2) dengan 1 Gaussian:\")\nprint(f\"  Forward KL (Mode-Covering): mu={mu_f:+.3f}, sigma={sig_f:.3f} | KL={res_fwd.fun:.4f} | Q(0)={q_fwd_zero:.4f}\")\nprint(f\"  Reverse KL (Mode-Seeking) : mu={mu_r:+.3f}, sigma={sig_r:.3f} | KL={res_rev.fun:.4f} | Q(0)={q_rev_zero:.6f}\")\nprint(f\"  Densitas target sejati di lembah P(0.0) = {p_zero:.6f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "Aproksimasi Distribusi Bimodal P = 0.5*N(-3,0.7^2) + 0.5*N(+3,0.7^2) dengan 1 Gaussian:\n  Forward KL (Mode-Covering): mu=+0.000, sigma=3.081 | KL=0.7887 | Q(0)=0.1295\n  Reverse KL (Mode-Seeking) : mu=+3.000, sigma=0.700 | KL=0.6931 | Q(0)=0.000059\n  Densitas target sejati di lembah P(0.0) = 0.000059",
