          "actualOutput": "Audit Strict Propriety: Mengapa Manipulasi Skor Gagal Mengalahkan Probabilitas Sejati:\nStrategi Skor          | Acc@0.5 | LogLoss |   Brier | Rel(Cal) |     Res |     Unc\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHonest (q = p_true)    |  0.7730 |  0.4830 |  0.1585 |  0.00026 | 0.02468 | 0.18344\nOverconfident (2.2x)   |  0.7730 |  0.5812 |  0.1724 |  0.01307 | 0.02181 | 0.18344\nUnderconfident (0.45x) |  0.7730 |  0.5360 |  0.1766 |  0.01820 | 0.02374 | 0.18344",
